     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A* FILE:      LOTMSTR
     A* SYSTEM:    APEX Nutritional Manufacturing — IBM i
     A* PURPOSE:   Lot Master — central lot tracking table
     A*             Every raw material receipt, blend lot, and finished
     A*             good lot has exactly one row here. QA status on this
     A*             table is the single source of truth for lot disposition.
     A*             FDA 21 CFR Part 11 audit trail is maintained via
     A*             LOTAUDIT (written by trigger LOTMSTR_TRG).
     A* KEYS:      LOTNO + LOTITEM (unique)
     A* RELATED:   INGRISS, CNTNRFIL, QLTHOLD, BLNDORDR
     A* CREATED:   2023-08-01   J.MARTINEZ
     A* MODIFIED:  2025-11-14   S.PATEL  — Added LREGION, LCOUNTRY
     A*             2026-05-03   R.CHEN   — Added LRETEST fields
     A*%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
     A          R RLOTMSTR
     A*
     A* -- Lot Identification --
     A            LOTNO          16A         TEXT('Lot Number')
     A            LOTITEM        18A         TEXT('Item Number')
     A            LITEMDSC       40A         TEXT('Item Description')
     A            LITMTYPE        2A         TEXT('Item Type: RM=Raw Mat FG=Fin Gd')
     A*                                      BL=Bulk IN=Intermediate PK=Packaging
     A            LSUPPLIER      10A         TEXT('Supplier Code')
     A            LSUPPLNO       20A         TEXT('Supplier Lot Number')
     A*
     A* -- Quantities --
     A            LQTYRCVD        9S 3       TEXT('Quantity Received')
     A            LQTYAVAIL       9S 3       TEXT('Quantity Available')
     A            LQTYHOLD        9S 3       TEXT('Quantity On Hold')
     A            LQTYUSED        9S 3       TEXT('Quantity Used / Issued')
     A            LQTYDEST        9S 3       TEXT('Quantity Destroyed')
     A            LUOM            3A         TEXT('Unit of Measure')
     A*
     A* -- Status --
     A            LQASTAT         2A         TEXT('QA Status')
     A*                                      AP=Approved  PE=Pending
     A*                                      HO=Hold      RJ=Rejected
     A*                                      QU=Quarantine EX=Expired
     A*                                      RE=Retest    RC=Recalled
     A            LHOLDRSN       60A         TEXT('Hold Reason Description')
     A*
     A* -- Dates --
     A            LMFGDT          8S 0       TEXT('Manufacture Date CCYYMMDD')
     A            LEXPDT          8S 0       TEXT('Expiry Date CCYYMMDD')
     A            LRCVDT          8S 0       TEXT('Received Date CCYYMMDD')
     A            LSAMPLDT        8S 0       TEXT('Sample Date CCYYMMDD')
     A            LRETESTDT       8S 0       TEXT('Retest Date CCYYMMDD')
     A            LRETESTBY      10A         TEXT('Retest Requested By')
     A*
     A* -- Origin --
     A            LSUPSITE       10A         TEXT('Supplier Site Code')
     A            LREGION         3A         TEXT('Region Code: NAM EUR APAC')
     A            LCOUNTRY        3A         TEXT('Country of Origin ISO3')
     A*
     A* -- Storage --
     A            LSTORLOCN      10A         TEXT('Primary Storage Location')
     A            LSTORTEMP       5S 1       TEXT('Required Storage Temp C')
     A            LSTORHUMD       5S 1       TEXT('Required Humidity Pct')
     A*
     A* -- Audit --
     A            LCRTBY         10A         TEXT('Created By')
     A            LCRTDT          8S 0       TEXT('Created Date CCYYMMDD')
     A            LCHGBY         10A         TEXT('Last Changed By')
     A            LCHGDT          8S 0       TEXT('Last Changed Date')
     A            LCHGTM          6S 0       TEXT('Last Changed Time')
     A*
     A          K LOTNO
     A          K LOTITEM
